        "answer": {
          "short": "$3b-4$, $b+b+b-4$, $3\\times b-4$",
          "worked": "Tripling gives $3b$, then removing four gives $3b-4$. The matching expressions are $3b-4$, $b+b+b-4$ and $3\\times b-4$.",
